  "details": "Help Improve and expand Udon by adding support for other controllers in vrchat\n-With the binding update, plug and play for certain controllers in now possible\n-xbox controller support is native within unity but currently lacking in VRChat, the ability to remap controls and the new action menu can fill in that gap\n-Flightsticks/Racing wheels and simulator equipment support would be exemplary for Udon, having a perfect creator based environment to take advantage of this equipment and further interactivity in worlds rather than relying exclusively on existing methods\n-ability to use a mix of controls helps maximize VRChat's interactivity, meaning people without vr but with Simulator equipment can use their existing gear to play into the VRC ecosystem",
